// The static client of sprites.trebeljahr.com: an assets-only Worker.
//
// No `main`, `routes`, `cache` or `run_worker_first`: each would turn free
// asset requests into counted Worker requests, and a `routes` key would make
// `wrangler deploy` manage the zone's routes. The routes are made once outside
// Wrangler (scripts/ROLLING_RELEASE.md, "Client on Cloudflare"):
//   sprites.trebeljahr.com/api/*                          -> no Worker (Coolify)
//   sprites.trebeljahr.com/.well-known/acme-challenge/*   -> no Worker (Traefik)
//   sprites.trebeljahr.com/*                              -> sprite-tools-client
// CI uploads a version per commit (`wrangler versions upload`) and activates
// it after the accounts server is verified (`wrangler versions deploy`).
{
  "name": "sprite-tools-client",
  "compatibility_date": "2026-10-01",
  "workers_dev": false,
  "preview_urls": false,
  "assets": {
    "directory": "./out",
    "html_handling": "auto-trailing-slash",
    "not_found_handling": "404-page"
  }
}
